OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying fine
OL,6,Fand dry across the east this evening,
OL,7,Fwith cloud spreading into western
OL,8,Fparts. Cloud will gradually push
OL,9,Feastward, with the odd shower
OL,10,Fpossible. Cloud clearing northern
OL,11,Fparts through the early hours with
OL,12,Fclear spells to follow.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FA grey start in the south but
OL,15,Fthis will gradually clear, leaving a
OL,16,Ffine and sunny day across the region.
OL,17,FFeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
